Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我悼念爱妻期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The factions and the fighting that went on inside this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宫廷内发生的朋党之争令我深恶痛绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I mourned were unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现任命你为枢密院议长及总务大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am appointing you president of the council and lord great master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在期间 所有大小事务皆由您负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in my absence, all will be answerable to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而非克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}not Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时指派爱德华·西摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am also appointing Edward Seymour to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}负责调查珀尔家族的活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Investigate the activities of the Poles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从现在起 他们都是嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, they are all under suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的家人还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的妻子小产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife lost the child she was carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们俩都失去一些东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have both lost something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 有时我想我快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Charles, sometimes I think I shall go mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的腿毒又发作了 疼痛难忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}My leg is poisoned and hurts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真怕我儿子会死于瘟疫 每想至此我夜不能寐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that my son will die of the plague and I cannot sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.67,0:02:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我知道我们都失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I know what it is that we have both lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们失去了我们的青春\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lost our youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上没有能够失而复得的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in the world that can ever return it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿主你的名为万人所称颂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benedictionem tuam domine, populus fidelis accipat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索尔兹伯里夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady salisbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}饿了吧 吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hungry, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么回事 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索尔兹伯里夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady salisbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我的无理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive this intrusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但您和您的家人因涉嫌叛国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and these members of your family are arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王下令拘捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the king's orders on suspicion of treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们必须都跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will all have to come straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不包括我的孙子吧 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my grandson, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使先生 我想与您私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to talk to you in private, monsieur l'ambassadeur,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我有意迎娶一位法国新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm inclined towards a french bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我的顾问大臣们认为我该结门皇室婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although my advisors think I should rather seek an imperial match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我钦佩陛下的品味 厌恶那些顾问大臣们的多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your majesty's taste, and deplore that of your advisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是他们不通人情 不像您和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they are not men of the world, as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的掌玺大臣跟我提起有两名法国新娘人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord privy seal spoke to me of two potential french brides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽亚 国王的女儿以及朗格维尔女士 吉斯的玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria, the king's daughter, and marie de guise, madame de longueville.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从我深入了解朗格维尔女士之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I have heard further of madame de longueville,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得她是妻子的不二之选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot refrain from considering her as a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好味道 桃子味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good nose. peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带点猫尿味 不是很甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cat's piss. not too sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您听到些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的女儿对我来说太年轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}King's daughter is too young for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但朗格维尔女士就合适多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But madame de longueville is much more suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个寡妇 已育有两个儿子 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being herself a widow and having already borne two sons, and being,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听他们所说 十分丰满迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As they say, very… voluptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我家主公告诉我说 若陛下能迎娶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master told me that he would think it a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国女子为新后 我们将荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your majesty were to take a french girl as your new wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我国女子任您挑选 除了朗格维尔女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no lady who is not at his command, except madame de longueville,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她早和苏格兰王订下了婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose marriage to the king of scotland has already been arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也可以悔婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That arrangement can be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你家主公 我可以付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your master that I can do twice as much for him as my nephew,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那苏格兰王白痴外甥 所给予的双倍条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idiotic and beggarly scottish king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 但事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… yes but, sir, in effect…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您就等于娶了他人的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, you would be marrying another man's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只娶我中意的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will marry who I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡斯特列先生 每个宫廷都给我提供了人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur castillon, I have received offers from every court.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我进言 法王陛下提议两门婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. But his majesty proposed a double marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他19岁的儿子亨利迎娶您的女儿玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nineteen year old son Henry to your daughter Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时您可迎娶郎格维尔女士的姐妹之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of madame de longueville's sisters to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:06:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有两个姐妹 路易斯和里内\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two of them, louise and renee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国宫廷盛传 前者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The former, remarkably for the french court,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍是处子之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is rumored to be still a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迎娶她 娶路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her. take louise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然她还是个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since she is still a maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还可以亲自开垦这片处女地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have the advantage of shaping the passage to your measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要见我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去把我的父亲找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在就要见我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my father now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我是谁 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, I know who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是珀尔少爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're master pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说你将来会是英国国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that some day you're going to be the king of england!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放开我 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me! Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得来商讨一下我的婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must discuss marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国人还是一如既往地令我难以下台\N{\fnArial\fs30}As usual, the french want to mess me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝提议什么人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does the emperor propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 罗马皇帝推举了克里斯蒂娜 他的外甥女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, the emperor has put forward christina, his niece,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米兰公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duchess of Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说她的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她出生于丹麦 13岁嫁给米兰大公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Originally from denmark, she was married at thirteen to the duke of milan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗切斯科·斯福尔扎 公爵一年后去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francesco sforza, who died a year later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她现年16岁 既是寡妇 又是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is now sixteen, both a widow and, apparently, still a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现居布鲁塞尔 同摄政者匈牙利的玛丽一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's living in brussels with the regent, Mary of Hungary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说她美貌无双\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is reported to be a great beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最喜欢狩猎 玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And likes nothing better than hunting and playing cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狩猎 玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm! hunting and playing cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经开始喜欢她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派我们在荷兰的大使去作深入了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have our ambassador in the netherlands find out more about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我国出使荷兰的大使 约翰·哈顿爵士到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, our ambassador to the netherlands, sir john hutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir john, i…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有一迫切要务交由您处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some most urgent business for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 瑞斯利先生已经告知我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, mr. risley has warned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去准备陛下的妻子候选人名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to make a list of potential candidates to share his majesty's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不谙挑选夫人之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not much experience among ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 此重任对我来说困难重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, this commission to me is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您要去布鲁塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to go to Brussels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您要去详细调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to make particular enquiries there about christina,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯蒂娜 米兰公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}christina Duchess of milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便\N{\fnArial\fs30}But while you are about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再行前往克里维斯公国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on to the duchy of cleves make enquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:09:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查公爵的二个姐妹 艾米利亚和安\N{\fnArial\fs30}There about the duke's two sisters amelia and anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我急切期望她们能列入候选名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am anxious that they should enter the reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要见我的儿子 你把我的儿子怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see my son. what have you done with my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的儿子在哪儿 - 你儿子平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is my son? - your son is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我们确定你们跟你的弟弟雷金纳德不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will remain unharmed until we are sure that you are not all traitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非叛国贼 他就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your brother reginald.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚我们家族已经和雷金纳德脱离关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know very well that my family has disowned reginald.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的母亲和我绝不纵容 也不会原谅他的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither my mother nor I supports or condones or what he has done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们公开宣示我们对陛下的忠诚拥护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We openly profess our allegiance to his gracious majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很欣赏我兄弟 红衣主教之所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i like well the proceeding of my brother, the cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫌恶此王国内所行之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}"but I like not the doings of this realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信世道会发生变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and I trust to see a change of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:10:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真希望我们都在海外\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i would wish that we were both over the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为英格兰国已变得荒淫扭曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the world in england waxes all crooked; "
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝的法律完全颠倒 修道院和教会都被推翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The god's law has been turned upside down, abbeys and churches overthrown…"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁给你那封信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you that letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你否认这是你写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny writing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王他日必将暴毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the king will die one day suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的坏腿将致他于死地 我们将会欢欣鼓舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}His leg will kill him, and we shall have jolly stirring."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的宣誓效忠徒有其表 蒙塔古大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your professions of loyalty were all hollow, my lord montague.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 你是国王的表亲 金雀花王朝的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, after all, the king's cousins, the last of the plantagenets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白玫瑰家族的后人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of the white rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人说你们波尔家族才是王朝的合法继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say you poles are the rightful heirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有朝一日必当皇冠加顶 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And will someday wear the garland." don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现已找到对蒙塔古勋爵 亨利·珀尔不利的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we found evidence against henry pole, lord montague,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还需找到指控他母亲的力证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need something against the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要求你 有这般不忠不义儿子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you whether such dishonest and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}母亲又怎么能诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treacherous sons could ever have had an honest mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是埃蒙特伯爵的遗孀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the widow of the earl of egmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个寡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A widow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}且慢 她看来是不像 但已年过40\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. it's true she doesn't look it, but she's over forty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但另一方面 宫廷内有一处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, there's a maid at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年仅14岁 但却凹凸有型\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only fourteen but she already has a goodly stature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水果成熟之前不要去采摘 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the fruit ripen before you pluck it, sir francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚收到约翰·哈顿爵士的函件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just received a letter from sir john hutton,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出使布鲁塞尔的大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador in brussels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他代表陛下前去问询调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been making enquiries on your majesty's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝的外甥女 米兰公爵夫人的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behalf about the duchess of milan, the emperor's niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他写道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He writes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不伦公爵夫人本人的美貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}"there is none in these parts for beauty of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是她的出身都无与伦比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Person "and birth to compare with the duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她纯洁无邪一如故世的王后 愿上帝保佑她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"she is not so pure white as the last queen, and god pardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微笑的时候 她的脸颊和下巴上有两个酒窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}"but when she smiles, there appear two dimples "in her cheeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更添她的迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one in her chin, which become her very well."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还提到了其他女士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he mentioned any other ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只提到了克里维斯公爵的妹妹 安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a sister of the duke of cleves. anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他写道 - 我听说过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He writes - I've heard about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说她一无是处 无论相貌还是人品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say she is of no great praise, either of her personage or her beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我 陛下 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, majesty, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这个联姻有他的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, such a match could have its advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我国一直以来都得看\N{\fnArial\fs30}This realm has long been at the mercy of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝或法国的眼色行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machinations of the french or of the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里维斯是新教同盟的成员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}But cleves is a member of the protestant league,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其发展势力在欧洲不可小觑 足以与他们抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which daily grows in power across europe and could easily rival theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, at last…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:14:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国终将不必仰他人鼻息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could england make its own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管如此 我还是想多了解米兰公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, I am anxious to see more of the duchess of milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想确定她是否真的如哈顿形容的那般貌美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be sure she's as beautiful as hutton claims.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立刻派荷尔拜画师前去画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send master holbein to do a sketch of her by next tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是 陛下 - 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - master cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 请您许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能否请问您 是否会考虑与我王联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask if you would consider marrying the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以问 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may ask, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于我的选择 您知道我听命于罗马皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for my inclination, you know I am at the emperor's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:15:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若您嫁给我家主公 您定会快乐无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}How happy you shall be if it be your chance to be matched with my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall i? why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我家主公是世上最优雅的绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh… my royal master is the most gentle gentleman that lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和蔼可亲 平易近人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nature is so benign and pleasant that till this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迄今为止 没有很多人 没有一个人听到他口出恶言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think no man has heard many, if any angry words pass his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下三位王后的相继离世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not strange that the king's majesty was in so little space.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}rid of his three queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人怀疑其原配夫人 我的曾舅母 是被毒害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they suspect that the first my great aunt was poisoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二位无辜被处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second innocently put to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三位因缺少照料而产后即死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the third lost for lack of care in her childbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坦率地说 先生 如果我有两个脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, sir, if I had two heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么可以拿一个去服侍贵主上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one would be at his majesty's service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜 我只有一个脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, I have only this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 容我为我王申辩 他的良好品行 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me plead my master's better qualities and appeal to your heart. - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:16:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不劳您费心了 因为我不会改变心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not labor any further, for I shall not fix my heart that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非 罗马皇帝命令我服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, the emperor commands me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, madam…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir francis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金雀花王朝旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The royal banner of the plantagenets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝 那里还会有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, what expectation is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金雀花王家旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The royal banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有这个 在你的房子里发现的最有力的叛乱证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this, the most potent symbol of rebellion, discovered in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我只是个老妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am an old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没做任何错事或反叛国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done nothing wrong, or against the king's majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你依然与你的儿子雷金纳德·珀尔有联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still communicate with your son reginald pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不顾他是叛贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite him being a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疑你在与他共谋新的叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt you plot new treacheries with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.31,0:17:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这把年纪了 您怎么会这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you suppose that at my age,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有什么能力谋划叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am capable of plotting anything against anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只希望安享晚年 远离尘世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish only to live a quiet life, away from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仁慈的国王能否发发慈悲 宽恕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the king, in his mercy, could show pity and forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 你们全家都被控犯下反叛陛下的叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, you've all been attainted for high treason against his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证据对您极为不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evidence is great against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还指望什么呢 您该好好乞求宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you deserve, you may well beg mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但天知道你是否会得到宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who shall say if it be granted or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祖母 您在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandmother! where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祖母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米兰公爵夫人很迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duchess of milan is enchanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am singularly pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此画使她看来很俏丽 也非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}This picture makes her very pretty. very…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可别想打她主意 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your hands off her, charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚礼之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After our wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的小儿子将会册封为约克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our younger sons will be ennobled with the ancient dukedoms of york,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格洛斯特公爵 以及萨默塞特公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gloucester and somerset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}届时玛丽公主就能与唐·路易丝亲王成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And princess mary can marry don luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你要的吗 是不是 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you want, isn't it charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一场皇室联姻 正如当年沃尔西一直想让我娶一个法国新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}An imperial wedding, just as wolsey always wanted a french one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每人都自有谋划 我的需求无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has an agenda, and what I want doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珀尔家族有其谋划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the poles have an agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们都在议论关在伦敦塔里的那\N{\fnArial\fs30}People talk about that poor little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的小男孩和老索尔兹伯里夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the tower and poor old lady salisbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但让我告诉你 他们的血管里流动的是金雀花王朝的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me tell you, they have plantagenet blood in their veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲曾经告诫过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my father told me…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲告诫过我 斩草不除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father told me that if you leave even a sapling in the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春风吹又生\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day it will grow into a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不久以后塔里那小男孩大旗一挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then that little boy in the tower will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就可聚集4万军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have forty thousand troops flocking to his banners!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你就尝尝这恶果吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will be a sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去把国王御医找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the king's physician!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝份上 还不快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For god's sake, man. run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles! charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我必须要见陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord? I must see the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就如我必须见您的外甥 王子 却被您挡驾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I must see your nephew, the prince, sometimes, but you prevent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王卧病一个多星期了 音讯全无\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has lain ill for over a week. there has been no news about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果漫天谣言 甚至传言国王已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there are rumors. some say the king is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正合您意吧 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would suit you, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这样您外甥就能做国王 - 他只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Since your nephew would be king. - he is a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那对任何人都没益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be to no one's use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我不会 对你不会 对英格兰也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mine, not to yours, and not to england's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您准许 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission, your grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要借此机会去反驳那些谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like the opportunity to disprove those rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以上帝的名义 这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the name of god…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次他腿上的溃疡没能破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time the ulcer on his leg has failed to burst,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前都能破裂开\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it has always done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就去请外科开刀师来切开溃疡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then fetch the barber surgeons to lance it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样也许会使他丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给王子加派双重卫兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double the guards around the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许任何人接近他 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is to be allowed access to him. do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让弗朗西丝爵士接管一队杭斯顿宫的守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell sir francis to take a detachment of the guard to hunsdon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以使他们能以生命护卫玛丽公主的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he and they may keep watch over the princess mary with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为一旦国王驾崩 王子和她都各会有人拥立\N{\fnArial\fs30}For if the king dies, some will be for the boy, others for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万能的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 您曾提议启用外科开刀师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. cromwell, I bid you call for the surgeon barbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现准许此项要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will answer for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.69,0:25:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.89,0:25:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是世间最可爱 最漂亮的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the sweetest, prettiest boy that ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.74,0:25:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保他的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. cromwell. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您最近与卡斯特列沟通过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you spoken to castillon recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.33,0:26:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于郎格维尔女士的事他说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say about madame de longueville?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.53,0:26:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她 已经与苏格兰王结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has already got married to the king of scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.73,0:26:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.41,0:26:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要她见识了那里的鬼天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she sees what the weather is like up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使先生提到法王弗朗西斯的另外两个表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador mentioned there are two other cousins of king francis potentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.63,0:26:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可供陛下选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}available to your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凡尔登的玛丽和维恩的安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie de vendome and anne of lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.79,0:26:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凡尔登的玛丽已宣布她有意做修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie de vendome has already announced her intention to become a nun,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.64,0:26:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但卡斯特列认为这不成问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although castillon thought that not necessarily an obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的非常法式\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very french.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.11,0:26:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要画像 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need pictures. do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要看到她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得看看将陪伴我余生的女人是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see the woman who is going to be my companion for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.09,0:27:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同米兰公爵夫人的协商进行的如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the negotiations with the duchess of milan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姻亲关系存在问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is the problem of affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为罗马皇帝的侄女\N{\fnArial\fs30}As niece to the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.53,0:27:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵夫人就是阿拉贡凯瑟琳的孙甥女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duchess is therefore great niece to katherine of aragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.33,0:27:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种问题可通过教皇特许来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such obstacles might have been overcome by papal dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么现在此事就不成问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there is no question of that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但或许 作为英国教会的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}But perhaps, as head of the church of england,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝可以容我来发布特许\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor will allow me to make a dispensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.53,0:27:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下 自然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, majesty. naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得要个可人儿才能唤起我的恋爱之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take a good sport to make me feel amorous again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为你丈夫警告过你远离我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your husband warned you to stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.65,0:27:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他确实警告过 但现在他不可不关心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did. but now he doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:28:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他不屑杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he couldn't be bothered to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.56,0:28:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗 由于对你丈夫所知甚少 我越对他有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the less I know about your husband the more he fascinates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.81,0:28:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我多少了解点多数人的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, more or less, where most people stand…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像萨福克 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like suffolk, cromwell…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.67,0:28:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纵然他们努力掩饰 我也知道他们的所思所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know their true beliefs, even if they try to hide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而爱德华 谁知道他内心真正的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But edward, who knows what he truly believes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.74,0:28:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 要不要我来告诉你呢 - 作为我服务的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like me to tell you? - for services rendered!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.59,0:28:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可没你自己想的那么棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not quite as good as you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.88,0:28:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还是很棒的 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's still pretty good. tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.88,0:28:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只信他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.25,0:28:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他的命运里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.56,0:28:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子才是通往他天命的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince edward is the key to his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么挡得了他的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing will stand in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a reformer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.61,0:28:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 说吧 我也是呢 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can answer. I am too, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.43,0:28:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人人都知道我对天主教派深恶痛绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows I hate popery with a passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.49,0:28:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以有时他们才会叫我耶稣会教长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why sometimes they call me the black pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.74,0:28:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 我刚被教皇搞过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! I've just been fucked by the pope!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.45,0:29:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奉圣父圣子及圣神之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}E nomine patri, et filii e spiritus sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是怎么看克伦威尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he think about cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.75,0:29:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人抓到射杀罗伯特·帕金顿议员的凶手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone ever discover who shot robert packington, mp?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.83,0:29:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我虽然行过死阴的幽谷 也不怕遭害 因为你与我同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si ambulem in mediio umbrae mortis, non timebo mala.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.61,0:29:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蒙塔古大人 我是来帮您去往美好之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord montague, I am here to help you to a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们知道我是无辜的 你们这群杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not guilty, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的兄弟才有罪 但你们却碰不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only my brother is guilty, but you can't touch him, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:29:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以只能滥杀无辜来交差\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have to kill the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.88,0:30:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的罪行已确认无误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guilt has been established beyond question.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.27,0:30:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个国度 过去曾有规程\N{\fnArial\fs30}There used to be procedures here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完善的法律程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proper legal procedures in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.97,0:30:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}判定谁有罪 谁无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To establish who is guilty and who is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.94,0:30:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.57,0:30:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们甚至都无需进行审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even have to have a trial…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.31,0:30:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以既然没了司法制度 剩下的唯有暴政了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So since there is no judiciary, what's left is only tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.33,0:30:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我母亲在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.97,0:30:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索尔兹伯里夫人就在这儿 在塔里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady salisbury is here, within the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.48,0:30:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请好好关照她 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please have a care for her, my lord bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论她做了什么冒犯您的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever she may have done, be it so offensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.17,0:30:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已是个年迈忠诚的老妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is an old and true woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.77,0:30:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕生都遵循上帝的教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}And has always lived under the precepts of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.69,0:30:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会好生照料着她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have a tender care for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.57,0:30:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全心全意 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body and soul, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.74,0:31:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.02,0:31:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.41,0:31:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王从未成就过人 但他会一再毁灭人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king never made a man, but he destroyed him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.97,0:31:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以小心行事吧 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take good care, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.59,0:31:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.45,0:31:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起其他人 我更喜欢这些法国女孩的长相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the look of some of these french girls more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.48,0:31:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但画像可信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can the likeness be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.11,0:31:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些画家美化人物不是奉承这些女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could the artist be not using some lies to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.27,0:31:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是取悦我 即使荷尔拜也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flatter the lady or please me? even master holbein?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:32:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没见过她们真人要我怎么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I make a decision on these girls when I haven't met them in flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.03,0:32:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去跟卡斯特列谈谈 - 遵命陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talk to castillon. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.44,0:32:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下是否能再次考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your majesty might still choose to consider the.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单纯但又魅力无限的克里维斯的安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple but profound charms of anne of cleves or of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.66,0:32:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是她的姐妹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.06,0:32:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同这个基督教国家结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of the benefits to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.58,0:32:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您和我国颇能从中受益\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to this realm of a new alignment with the protestant league?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.45,0:32:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温彻斯特主教大人觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His grace the bishop of winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My lord bishop. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.22,0:32:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.87,0:32:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我的突然拜访 但我注意到某些新教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me but it has come to my attention that certain evangelicals are still.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.95,0:32:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍在布道说教 公然反对教义六条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preaching against the six articles of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.03,0:32:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和陛下的宗教教义\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your majesty's religious agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.57,0:33:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·兰伯特先生也是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.John lambert is one such,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.38,0:33:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一星期在伦敦面向广大民众做一次布道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who preaches once a week in london to large audiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.61,0:33:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰伯特先生拒绝承认圣餐仪式中圣体的真实存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Lambert denies the real presence of god in the sacrament of communion,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.28,0:33:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反而说这仅仅是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying rather that it is merely a…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.00,0:33:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耶稣受难的象征性纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbolic commemoration of the passion christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.42,0:33:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么兰伯特先生会因耶稣的原话被判有罪 祂说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then mr.Lambert will be condemned in christ's own words, who said,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.07,0:33:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"this is my body".
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要么放弃信仰要么被处火刑 我是不会庇护异教徒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will recant or be burned; I will not patron heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.01,0:33:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there more?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这不关我的事 陛下 但我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it is none of my business, your majesty, but I am told that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.21,0:33:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰伯特先生和克伦威尔大人关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Lambert is well known to my lord cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.24,0:33:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们似乎曾一起在剑桥接受教育\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears that they were educated together at cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.04,0:33:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then some six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:34:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰伯特因涉嫌进行异教宣传而被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}When lambert was apprehended on suspicion of promoting religious heresy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.59,0:34:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人撤回了此项指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord cromwell had the charges dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.24,0:34:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my lord bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王同米兰公爵夫人的联姻进展得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news of the king's marriage to the duchess of milan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.48,0:34:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唉 公主 我认为这是不太可能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, princess, I think it is not to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.68,0:34:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵夫人是您母亲的孙外甥女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duchess is the great niece of your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姻亲关系太紧密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so the affinity is too touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.90,0:34:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时我也觉得那位夫人并不想嫁给国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I think the lady does not want to marry the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.03,0:34:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我也不能嫁给唐路易斯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then… I shall not marry don luis?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.43,0:34:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说国王现在有可能会娶个法国小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say the king may now marry a french lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.67,0:34:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而您会许配给法国国王的某个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you one of the french king's sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.15,0:35:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这显然不合您意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely that would not please you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.78,0:35:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要您欢喜 我的小姐 我就欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything would please me, my lady, which made you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.19,0:35:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只怕我生来就得不到幸福 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid I was not born for happiness, excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说索尔兹伯里夫人还被囚禁在塔楼内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear lady salisbury is been kept in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.21,0:35:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她儿子已经被处决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her son executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.25,0:35:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实令人唏嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is sadly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.25,0:35:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的孙子也成了阶下囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her grandson too is being kept a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.58,0:35:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这肯定都是克伦威尔干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure it is all cromwell's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.03,0:35:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话我不可以对别人说 阁下 但我可以对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should not say this to many people, excellency, but I say it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.03,0:35:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即我很同意他是撒旦使者的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I agree with those who say he is messenger of satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.96,0:35:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓他毒害了国王的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear he has poisoned the king's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.89,0:35:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我可以 我会把他从国王身边拖走 然后烧死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I could, I would strip him from the king's side and burn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:36:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国大使阁下觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His excellency, the french ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.63,0:36:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 卡斯特列先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monsieur castillon. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.20,0:36:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已比较了现有所有候选人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been considering all these candidates for our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.66,0:36:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有好多呢 - 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There are so many. - indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.82,0:36:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一大群温文尔雅的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warren of honorable ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.36,0:36:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.65,0:36:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事实上 在此等情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fact is, in the circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.64,0:36:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她们个个如此迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because so many of them appear attractive,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.58,0:36:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知如何才能单独召见她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not see how I can approach them individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.69,0:36:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王能否安排七到八个到加来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps king francis can assemble seven or eight of them at calais,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.48,0:36:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我可以去那里 一起见面接触一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I could go there and make their acquaintances all at the same time…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 法国没有派送贵族小姐的惯例\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It is not a french custom to send ladies of that rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.82,0:36:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其这些女士都来自最高贵的王侯贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of such noble and princely families,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.13,0:36:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更别说送去候选 如同出售马匹一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be passed in review as if they were prize horses…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.62,0:36:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果陛下看中了某位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if your majesty desires one of these ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许可以按传统做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could send an envoy to report on her manner and appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.56,0:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派一名使节向您汇报她的仪态外貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the traditional way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.98,0:36:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust no one but myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.74,0:36:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事事关己身\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing touches me too near.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.48,0:36:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要在作出决定前 看到并了解她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see and know them before deciding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.96,0:37:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许陛下想一个个品尝过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your majesty would like to mount them one after another,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后选个最上手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then pick the one you find best broken in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.56,0:37:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡斯特列先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur castillon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.07,0:37:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有十秒钟时间离开我的宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ten seconds to get out of my court,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.04,0:37:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我会打的你满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I will beat you like the dog that you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.06,0:37:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. cromwell. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.13,0:37:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个无药可救的异教徒叫约翰·兰伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}An incorrigible heretic called john lambert is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.57,0:37:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正囚禁在塔楼内 可能快处以火刑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imprisoned in the tower and likely soon to be burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你认识这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许多年前 我在剑桥的时候认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him, many years ago. at cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后就不联络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.59,0:37:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to my knowledge, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.82,0:37:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你们一起在剑桥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whilst you were at cambridge together,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.28,0:37:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟他有什么志同道合的观点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you share some of his opinions?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.65,0:38:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说 克伦威尔先生 你现在到底信仰什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, mr. cromwell, what do you believe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.29,0:38:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天地为证 陛下 我信仰陛下的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the world stands, your majesty, I believe what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你也同意他理该被烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think it right that he should be burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.31,0:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 除非他放弃信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. unless he recants.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.15,0:38:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我差点儿忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她们的名字叫什么来着 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What were their names again? - majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.03,0:38:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里维斯公爵的两个姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sisters of the duke of cleves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.56,0:38:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米利亚和安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia and anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.45,0:38:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米利亚和安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia and anne…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.16,0:38:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派人去了解下她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send someone to take a look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.11,0:38:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们可能要退而求其次了 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll have a second opinion. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.55,0:38:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天鹅宫 克里夫斯 德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swan Castle, Cleves, Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉姆公爵现在接见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke william will receive you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.04,0:39:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国使者觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The english envoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.19,0:39:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 - 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen. - your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说亨利国王需要个妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So his majesty king henry needs a wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.24,0:39:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对我的妹妹们感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is interested in my sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下听闻她们性情温和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, His majesty has been persuaded of their.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.24,0:39:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很符合皇室配偶的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amiability and of their suitability as royal consorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.86,0:39:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是安 年长的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially anne, the eldest,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.37,0:39:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下闻知这位小姐颇受好评\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has been much praised in the king's hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.16,0:39:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不感到惊奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也提议将他的女儿玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty would also propose the.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.79,0:39:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许配给您的长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage of his daughter mary to your eldest son; a.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.14,0:39:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这将会是一场新教徒的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liaison with the protestant league,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.03,0:40:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有为他的军队征集数百位善战的炮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the recruitment of a hundred seasoned cannoneers for his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.40,0:40:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此说来 先生们 我们还有很多事要商讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is, then, gentlemen, much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实如此 但首先请允许我们 见见您的妹妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed. but first, we should like your permission to meet your sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.18,0:40:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.56,0:40:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王要求我们据亲眼所见如实汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king will expect us to report back on what we have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.10,0:40:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果没亲眼见到这些女士 国王会不高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say that we have not seen the ladies would not exactly please him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.65,0:40:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他同时要求我们带回一副安的肖像\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has also asked for a portrait of anne to be sent back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.68,0:40:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不巧 我的宫廷画师克兰纳克先生身体抱恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, my court painter mr. crananch is ill and indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.55,0:40:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此 我们可以派世人敬仰的艺术家荷尔拜先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, we can send over mr. holbein, who is an admirable artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.54,0:40:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.88,0:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你们进行得太快了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are going too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们以为我的国家是什么 肉市吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think my country is? a meat market?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.09,0:41:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会安排大臣们商讨此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will arrange with my chancellor for negotiations to commence,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.73,0:41:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到了一定阶段 你们可以有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may have the opportunity, at some stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.15,0:41:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引荐给我的妹妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of being presented to my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.39,0:41:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 殿下 我们 - 我们会再见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your highness, - we will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.85,0:41:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.17,0:41:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.97,0:41:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.38,0:41:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在宫里干得真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how excellently you have done in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真希望我们的重逢能在更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could wish our reunion was in some better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很快就能离开这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be quit of this place soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.61,0:41:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后去往一个更美好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on my way to a far better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.87,0:42:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 你没必要去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you do not have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.86,0:42:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只需要投其所好 在献祭仪式后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to say to satisfy the king is that, after consecration,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宣称圣饼和红酒确实是耶稣的真体和血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wafer and wine are truly the body and blood of christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.75,0:42:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你我明知它们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and I know that they are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.59,0:42:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不用相信 你只要说出来就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to believe it, you just have to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.75,0:42:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, thomas…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.63,0:42:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我终于明白一个人在俗世中获得成功要付出什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now what it takes for a man to make his way in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.16,0:42:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必须伪善\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must make a practice of hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谨慎行事并没有坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no harm in discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.37,0:42:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.14,0:42:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想免去你即将面临的苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to spare you the awful pains which have been prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.13,0:42:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 耶稣不也承受了巨大的苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did christ himself not suffer awful pains, thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.81,0:42:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不需要殉道者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not need martyrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.76,0:42:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要活生生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need living men who will go on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样才能慢慢开展我们的改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quietly spreading the business of our reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.93,0:42:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我在这么基础的问题上动摇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who will believe a word I say if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么谁还会相信我所说的话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alter my opinion on such a fundamental thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.13,0:43:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 我再问你一次 我至少能给你个自由的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I say to you again, while at least I have a free choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.84,0:43:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想死还是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you live or die?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.86,0:43:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear lord cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.71,0:43:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发觉此刻我们谈论的并不是我 而是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that all this while we have not been talking about me but about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.59,0:43:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我的良心 而是你的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not about my poor conscience but about yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.49,0:43:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到你害怕承担连带责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that you are afraid of guilt by association,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.84,0:43:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至期待我欺骗自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would rather I perjured my own soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.51,0:43:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜 这是我在世间所剩的唯一的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, it is the only thing in the world I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.88,0:43:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不愿自救我感到很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry you choose not to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.65,0:43:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛徒们 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back you rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.44,0:43:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以国王的名义 你们都退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the name of the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.36,0:44:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会为你祈祷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pray for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.75,0:44:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为耶稣献身 为耶稣献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for christ! all for christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.15,0:44:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.57,0:45:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兰伯特先生施刑完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. lambert has gone to his execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.62,0:45:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.42,0:45:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主请求您放索尔兹伯里女士一条生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess mary begs you to spare the life of lady salisbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.42,0:45:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说 她就如同她母亲一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, she says, was like a mother to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.26,0:45:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也是雷金纳德·珀尔的母亲 那人连上帝也不会原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was also a mother to reginald pole, whom even heaven can't forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.66,0:45:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉姆公爵称他的画师病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke william says that his painter is ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.99,0:45:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不能提供她妹妹安的画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot furnish images of his sister anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.70,0:45:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派荷尔拜去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.92,0:45:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要看到她的画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must see her image.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.34,0:45:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - mr. cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.25,0:46:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.17,0:46:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我容许你们一睹我妹妹们的芳容\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my permission to look upon my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.03,0:46:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下 我们甚至不能分辨谁是安谁是艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness, we cannot even tell which is anne and which amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.13,0:46:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 我是安 - 我是艾米利亚 大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sirs, I am anne. - and I am amelia, your honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.99,0:46:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据我们的目的 这样可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our purposes, this is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.94,0:47:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 什么 难道你们要看她们裸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good? what? would you see them naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.77,0:47:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道您不祷告吗 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not been praying, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您现在就要被砍头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head is going to be cut off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.68,0:47:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想死 我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.98,0:47:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 求求你 不要伤害我 求你 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please don't hurt me. please, no. don't! don't! don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.45,0:47:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别伤害我 我还不想死 我还不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt me! I don't want to die! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.13,0:47:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要 不要杀死我 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! don't kill me! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝救我啊 上帝救我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God save me! god help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.66,0:47:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 留点尊严吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For god's sake, have some dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.43,0:47:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我还不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.14,0:48:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教阁下 - 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eminence… - my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我可怜的孩子 - 他杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My poor child. - he's killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.07,0:48:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的哥哥 还有我可怜的母亲 耶稣啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother! my poor mother! oh, jesus! jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.99,0:48:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国国王是最残酷最让人憎恶的暴君\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of england is the most cruel and abominable tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.96,0:48:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 他应该被武力推翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt now, he must be overthrown by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.91,0:48:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起永世遭受臣民的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better that he should die,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.58,0:48:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还不如现在就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than risk the eternal damnation of all his subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.65,0:48:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.46,0:48:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.07,0:48:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇陛下准备宣布将他逐出教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}His holiness is ready to promulgate the bull of excommunication.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.09,0:48:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马和法国已经建交\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor and the french have made peace and they.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.24,0:48:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都愿意向英国宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are now both willing to point their swords at england.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.92,0:48:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会撤出他们的大使 并准备战舰开始进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will withdraw their ambassadors and prepare a fleet for invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.70,0:48:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇希望你回到荷兰和法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the holy father expects you to return to the.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.95,0:48:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去协助他们的准备工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Netherlands and to france to assist their preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.88,0:48:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.87,0:49:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我用别德方法来帮忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help in other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.76,0:49:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 说说看 难道你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? tell me. are you frightened?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.95,0:49:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该感谢上帝召你家人到天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should thank god that he has called your family to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.83,0:49:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不应该哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.17,0:49:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不顺从上帝 不顺从上帝的旨意还算什么信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is belief if not belief in the will of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.63,0:49:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你认为教皇派你去荷兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the holy father wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.44,0:49:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了他自己的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go to the netherlands for his own sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.63,0:49:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道不认为他先请示过上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think he has asked god for guidance?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.51,0:49:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.82,0:49:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻的时候 我在德国担任牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a young priest in germany,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.03,0:49:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我家被路德教会雇佣兵占领\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family's house was occupied by lutheran mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.29,0:49:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个漂亮的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a beautiful sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.61,0:49:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱她胜过世间一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whom I loved more than anything else in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.19,0:49:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 甚至比爱上帝更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps even more than god.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.85,0:49:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们强奸了她 然后切下她的双乳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they raped her, they cut off her breasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.39,0:50:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们当着我的面 把她的碎尸拿去喂狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They threw pieces of her to their dogs, right in front of my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.40,0:50:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个人都有自己的重担 珀尔红衣主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us have burdens to carry, cardinal pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.52,0:50:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来吧 珀尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along now, master pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.90,0:51:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过 珀尔红衣主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, cardinal pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.53,0:51:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该是你痛不欲生的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now eat your heart.
